      <div type="clause" n="66">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 66</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif men sie se earm mid honda mid ealle ofácorfen beforan elmbogan, gebete ðæt mid LXXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a man’s arm including his hand is cut off below the elbow, let him compensate that with 80 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man's arm, with the hand and all below the elbow, is cut off, 80 shillings shall be paid as compensation for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif men sy se earm mid honda mid ealle ofacorfen beforan elbogan, gebete ðæt mid LXXX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
